    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Todd are delighted to bring this four bed bugalow on a large site to the market in Cloonfad. There are some houses that are relatively small in size and in impact, this charming four-bedroom detached bungalow in Cloonfad is certainly not one of them. Though relatively small on a first impression it certainly packs a punch. You enter through a bright hallway with living room on the left. This room has solid wooden flooring and an open fireplace. The house has a total of four good sized double bedrooms. The kitchen is located at the rear of the house. The kitchen has a good supply of of shaker units with wood effect laminate and integrated oven and hob. Two bathrooms and a utility area complete the accommodation. The property is very well located on a large raised site approximately 1km from the village of Cloonfad, 6km from Dunmore, 20km from Tuam and only 10km from Ballyhaunis. It is situated on a .75acre site. The garden surrounds the house on three sides and has an abundance of mature trees including shrubs and hedges with a very convenient saparate gate into the side garden. There are also two convenient closed and open sheds. The owners are leaving all the furniture and appliances in the house. This property qualifies for the 50k Vacancy Grant.This is a hidden gem with much to offer and viewing is highly recommended. Please contact Sherry FitzGerald Todd to book a viewing appointment on 09326622"
      },
      {
